WEBVTT

00:17.330 --> 00:18.830
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.710 --> 00:20.460
OH! The time has come

00:18.250 --> 00:18.830
BUSTERZ!

00:20.460 --> 00:23.840
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.790 --> 00:24.250
OH OH OH!

00:23.840 --> 00:26.420
We're ghostbusterz

00:25.710 --> 00:27.220
OH OH OH!

00:26.420 --> 00:31.050
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:31.050 --> 00:34.430
Of history

00:34.430 --> 00:37.810
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:13.300 --> 01:17.100
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.560 --> 01:17.060
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by Strelizia subs

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:10.280
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.280 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:46.600 --> 02:49.840
SOUL SEAL

03:02.560 --> 03:08.470
That damn Yasha was supposed to
bring me gifts but he still isn't back.

03:10.240 --> 03:18.720
I sold my soul to the ayakashi for power, but at the end of the day got nothing!

03:18.880 --> 03:20.480
Did I get tricked?

03:23.680 --> 03:24.940
How ugly I am...

03:31.920 --> 03:35.800
Even with these powers,
I cannot rule the country.

03:46.160 --> 03:47.960
I'm back.

03:48.160 --> 03:51.280
Yasha, you scared me!

03:53.160 --> 03:54.460
Who's that?

03:54.840 --> 03:57.280
The gift I promised you.

04:00.280 --> 04:03.670
Is that you, leyasu Tokugawa?

04:03.840 --> 04:06.960
You look more like a
hippopotamus than a fox.

04:07.560 --> 04:09.600
Hippopotamus?
What is that?

04:10.040 --> 04:12.400
An artiodactyl.

04:12.600 --> 04:15.750
Artio-what?
Are you a foreigner?

04:23.440 --> 04:24.580
Lord.

04:24.640 --> 04:27.520
Please forgive my long absence.

04:28.400 --> 04:30.300
What matters is that you're fine.

04:30.480 --> 04:32.600
- Sasuke Sarutobi!
- Yes!

04:33.080 --> 04:35.640
- It is his doppelganger!
- They look like twins!

04:36.760 --> 04:38.080
My name?

04:39.200 --> 04:43.080
I'm named Leonardo da Vinci, I'm a celebrity.

04:43.840 --> 04:45.910
Leonardo da Vinci?

04:46.880 --> 04:50.160
I've heard Christians talk about you before.

04:50.600 --> 04:54.120
If memory serves me well...

04:54.280 --> 04:56.870
Monaka... Monali...

04:57.040 --> 05:00.430
You are the one who painted
a beauty named Mona Lisa!

05:00.600 --> 05:01.640
That's right!

05:02.360 --> 05:05.320
I'm impressed!

05:05.480 --> 05:09.470
You're still smart even if
you became an ayakashi!

05:09.840 --> 05:16.240
But the painter, a certain
Leonardo, lived 100 years ago.

05:16.400 --> 05:19.040
Then why is he still alive?

05:19.200 --> 05:20.950
And why does he live in Japan?

05:25.680 --> 05:30.310
Da Vinci... Da Vingi... Davinji... Dabinoji?

05:30.760 --> 05:32.830
He wasn't a nobody.

05:33.600 --> 05:40.480
Is it true that you were turned into
a monkey with ayakashi magic?

05:40.960 --> 05:44.350
It was the worst defeat I've ever suffered.

05:57.120 --> 06:02.600
Here is the workshop of the man
who builds all the contraptions.

06:08.320 --> 06:15.910
In Osaka, I infiltrated the inventor's workshop
in order to discover his true identity.

06:16.800 --> 06:19.360
It was Dabinoji's workshop.

06:27.480 --> 06:28.390
Amazing!

06:39.680 --> 06:41.560
You are scary, my word.

06:42.800 --> 06:47.400
Your opponent is human.
No use showing distrust.

06:48.560 --> 06:51.310
You are probably right.

06:51.480 --> 06:59.200
But we, the ayakashi, have been facing
Yin-Yang monks since the dawn of time.

07:00.000 --> 07:03.150
We cannot underestimate human strength.

07:03.840 --> 07:05.590
Gotcha.

07:06.000 --> 07:10.070
It is said that humans, controlling
the path of Yin and Yang,

07:10.240 --> 07:15.480
have created artifacts that
could imprison ayakashi.

07:15.640 --> 07:18.950
They scattered them across seven castles.

07:20.000 --> 07:25.230
But no one knows where
they are hidden anymore,

07:25.400 --> 07:29.310
and the map that allowed
them to be located disappeared.

07:30.120 --> 07:34.030
That's why we need your ingenuity...

07:34.200 --> 07:37.320
to manufacture a
radar that will allow...

07:37.480 --> 07:41.520
us to find the seven castles
where the artifacts are located.

07:42.080 --> 07:43.430
I got it.

07:44.040 --> 07:45.950
But it's not finished.

07:46.160 --> 07:47.750
Is that so?

07:47.960 --> 07:50.080
You don't trust me?

07:53.200 --> 07:54.300
Yasha?

07:55.240 --> 07:56.440
Traitor!

08:00.600 --> 08:01.940
Dammit!

08:06.840 --> 08:08.880
A ninja?
Which clan do you belong to?

08:09.680 --> 08:11.830
Do you think I would tell you?

08:12.040 --> 08:15.800
If that's how it is, die!

08:24.800 --> 08:28.480
Stop, don't kill him!

08:28.640 --> 08:31.760
He knows the secret of the artifacts.

08:31.920 --> 08:33.430
I have to kill him.

08:34.120 --> 08:36.190
Even if I ask you not to?

08:38.120 --> 08:41.640
I'm not asking you to let him escape.

08:41.800 --> 08:45.400
Couldn't you turn him into
a monkey with your powers?

08:46.160 --> 08:50.470
A monkey?
Don't insult me! I'd rather die!

08:51.240 --> 08:54.600
If Leonardo da Vinci orders...

09:04.000 --> 09:06.470
I don't want to become a monkey!

09:15.920 --> 09:20.120
It will take a little
longer to finish the radar.

09:20.960 --> 09:22.710
You'll have to be patient.

09:23.240 --> 09:26.710
Very well.
What do we do about the monkey?

09:27.840 --> 09:30.310
He will be my pet.

09:37.280 --> 09:39.840
Is the legend of the artifacts real?

09:40.040 --> 09:42.870
Artifacts?
Do you know about it?

09:43.040 --> 09:45.760
I thought that was an old fairy tale.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.710
- Yume.
- Yes?

09:49.280 --> 09:53.750
Has your memory fully returned?

09:53.920 --> 09:57.960
You and I come from a faraway place.

09:58.120 --> 10:00.000
Far away...

10:02.680 --> 10:04.800
Leonardo da Vinci?

10:04.960 --> 10:07.950
Do you plan to ally with us?

10:09.760 --> 10:10.960
Who knows...

10:11.360 --> 10:12.580
What?

10:12.640 --> 10:14.600
I am nobody's ally.

10:15.440 --> 10:20.920
I stand by those who let
me create and invent freely.

10:21.080 --> 10:22.640
That's my <i>stance</i>.

10:23.160 --> 10:24.750
<i>Stance</i>?

10:24.920 --> 10:27.880
You want me to stand up for you?

10:30.320 --> 10:33.760
I have money.
You'll get what you want!

10:33.920 --> 10:37.390
Now, help me!
Allow me to take power!

10:37.560 --> 10:41.680
Help me crush the Toyotomi
and establish my shogunate!

10:43.160 --> 10:47.870
That's still real history.
I will help you!

10:48.440 --> 10:49.710
Thank you.

10:57.120 --> 11:04.550
As Sarutobi said, Old Dabinoji
and Yasha are in fact friends.

11:05.960 --> 11:14.550
I saw with my own eyes, they took Hideaki
Kobayakawa and disappeared using magic.

11:14.760 --> 11:18.670
I've always found that
old man suspicious, but...

11:18.880 --> 11:20.000
Yes?

11:20.840 --> 11:25.790
A guy like Dabinoji can ally
himself with the ayakashi...

11:25.960 --> 11:28.630
while plotting something
behind their backs.

11:28.840 --> 11:30.070
That's possible.

11:30.520 --> 11:36.670
But what is more surprising
is that Sarutobi was human.

11:37.440 --> 11:39.560
And that he was Ninjataro's double.

11:41.200 --> 11:44.000
If Ninjataro were here...

11:44.160 --> 11:46.390
I was thinking the same thing.

11:49.200 --> 11:50.470
Master Musashi!

11:50.640 --> 11:52.150
Princess Kaguya!

11:52.720 --> 11:53.990
Princess Kaguya!

11:54.720 --> 11:56.070
Speak of the devil...

11:56.240 --> 11:57.880
Ninjataro!

12:12.720 --> 12:13.950
What do you think?

12:14.160 --> 12:18.760
I think it is big enough for
an atelier and workshop.

12:20.640 --> 12:21.920
I like it.

12:22.360 --> 12:24.030
Thank you.

12:24.240 --> 12:29.080
Well? What do you
want from me in return?

12:29.480 --> 12:33.630
I want you to make my
subordinates stronger.

12:33.840 --> 12:35.130
Why?

12:35.440 --> 12:42.640
The Moon princesses... so
Ryogen can marry one of them.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.720
What a waste.

12:44.880 --> 12:47.870
They are too beautiful for fat leyasu.

12:48.080 --> 12:52.200
Of course, I have other ideas in mind.

12:52.360 --> 12:54.670
I wouldn't be surprised!

12:55.360 --> 12:56.630
Can I count on you?

12:57.720 --> 13:00.000
Are there no alternatives?

13:00.160 --> 13:03.520
An interloper prevents us from doing so.

13:04.120 --> 13:05.290
Musashi?

13:05.720 --> 13:10.110
At first, I took him for a vulgar little boy.

13:10.280 --> 13:12.350
It would appear that I was mistaken.

13:12.920 --> 13:17.360
Is he the one who will
become the legendary savior?

13:18.080 --> 13:22.520
Didn't you assure me that
it would be Kojiro Sasaki?

13:23.280 --> 13:27.350
That's what I thought.

13:27.520 --> 13:30.480
But as long as Musashi has the demon gun...

13:33.040 --> 13:37.870
It is kind of my fault that the
he learned about the famous gun.

13:38.440 --> 13:44.190
Frankly, I did not believe he
would be capable of controlling it.

13:45.040 --> 13:53.190
How ironic. I understand it's you who
introduced these guns into the world.

13:53.360 --> 13:59.470
If he gets his hands on the
other gun, the heaven gun,

13:59.640 --> 14:01.870
we're going down in flames.

14:02.440 --> 14:09.870
I understand. That's why you need to capture a Moon princess.

14:10.560 --> 14:13.520
Can I count on your cooperation?

14:14.400 --> 14:22.920
Even with my genius brain,
I cannot make ayakashi...

14:23.080 --> 14:29.110
of the ghost, spirit or monster
variety as strong as Musashi.

14:30.440 --> 14:34.400
Don't get mad, I'm not insulting you.

14:34.560 --> 14:38.190
Ghosts and spirits lack passion.

14:39.640 --> 14:42.920
Your biggest flaw, Yasha...

14:43.080 --> 14:46.390
is to underestimate
his human emotions...

14:46.560 --> 14:49.950
which are stubbornness,
ambition and hatred.

14:50.600 --> 14:58.760
Merging the soul of a living human with
that of an ayakashi is a daunting task.

14:59.400 --> 15:02.790
There's no need to use a living human.

15:13.480 --> 15:14.880
Real doppelgangers!

15:15.440 --> 15:17.560
Like two drops of water...

15:18.560 --> 15:19.680
Sasuke Sarutobi.

15:20.960 --> 15:25.910
Have you ever heard about a
sibling you got separated from?

15:26.520 --> 15:28.350
No, never.

15:28.920 --> 15:30.720
Pleased to meet you...

15:32.560 --> 15:34.200
His name is Ninjakuro.

15:34.800 --> 15:37.630
He is a genius ninja like Sarutobi.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.670
I am Ninja<i>taro</i>!

15:40.240 --> 15:45.230
Ninjakuro, would you agree to
work for me, with Sarutobi?

15:45.760 --> 15:49.800
Good idea!
And given the similarity...

15:49.960 --> 15:53.720
I don't even need to teach the
cloning technique, Ninjajiro.

15:53.880 --> 15:56.130
I said it's "<i>taro</i>"!

15:56.600 --> 16:03.150
But if he has to work for you, shouldn't
he give a demonstration of his technique?

16:03.320 --> 16:05.600
That's pretty obvious.

16:06.840 --> 16:08.800
Why do you say that?

16:09.480 --> 16:16.470
Sanada's ninja troop has existed since Shingen
Takeda, they can be called the elite of ninjas.

16:16.640 --> 16:18.740
This is a chance to practice your skills.

16:19.080 --> 16:23.280
But I want to serve you.

16:23.440 --> 16:25.320
- Ninjataro.
- Yes?

16:26.080 --> 16:28.640
"Journeys shape youth" or so they say.

16:28.800 --> 16:34.590
I expect you to become a
perfect ninja by following Sanada.

16:35.400 --> 16:40.000
Master Musashi!
Master Ronin!

16:40.160 --> 16:41.960
I will do my best!

16:42.840 --> 16:46.070
I will show you my technique!

16:47.680 --> 16:49.110
Don't disappoint me.

16:49.280 --> 16:51.560
Sasuke, he's your opponent.

16:54.640 --> 16:56.790
Let's clash with our techniques, Sasuke!

16:56.840 --> 17:01.360
Let's start with elementary techniques.
Concealment.

17:01.560 --> 17:02.470
What...

17:04.480 --> 17:06.390
Concealment!

17:06.600 --> 17:08.990
Wow, he is really good!

17:09.200 --> 17:12.800
My turn now.
Concealment!

17:16.120 --> 17:20.240
- He's still there...
- Let's move on to substitution.

17:20.440 --> 17:21.600
I expected that.

17:22.240 --> 17:24.390
Don't get hurt, Ninjataro!

17:24.600 --> 17:25.640
Same for you, Sasuke!

17:39.800 --> 17:42.270
Princess Kaguya, you're safe!

17:42.440 --> 17:44.590
Princess Yume, it's been so long.

17:44.800 --> 17:48.190
Mr. Danjo, do we know each other?

17:48.400 --> 17:53.030
Of course!
Have you forgotten me?

17:53.240 --> 17:57.680
Danjo, Yume has forgotten
all memories of the past.

17:57.840 --> 18:00.990
But she slowly recovers them.

18:01.560 --> 18:04.520
I'm sorry.
But Mr. Danjo...

18:04.680 --> 18:11.750
I know that you faced the ayakashi
alongside Princess Kaguya.

18:13.120 --> 18:16.110
Yume, what will you do now?

18:16.320 --> 18:20.080
I will protect Musashi.

18:20.280 --> 18:22.280
You will protect Musashi?

18:22.360 --> 18:24.000
That's my mission.

18:24.200 --> 18:28.670
Although I have lost my
memories, I am convinced of it.

18:33.840 --> 18:34.590
Master Musashi.

18:34.800 --> 18:37.460
What, Ninjahyakuro?
Why are you making that face?

18:37.560 --> 18:41.920
I'm sorry, but I am Sasuke Sarutobi.

18:42.120 --> 18:45.400
I know!
So what do you want?

18:46.360 --> 18:50.270
This was given to me
by Leonardo da Vinci.

18:51.280 --> 18:52.320
A map?

18:55.160 --> 18:56.750
There are seven castles...

18:57.480 --> 18:59.790
Are they perhaps <i>the</i> seven castles?

19:00.600 --> 19:04.720
Would this map indicate where
the artifacts are hidden?

19:05.920 --> 19:07.200
That map...

19:16.320 --> 19:19.390
Musashi, Ronin, I'm counting on you.

19:19.600 --> 19:26.030
You know, I'm not doing this
for you or for the shogunate!

19:26.200 --> 19:33.480
I just find hunting for artifacts
more fun than robbing castles!

19:33.960 --> 19:39.920
I know. But this will make it possible to
annihilate the ayakashi and protect the shogunate.

19:40.120 --> 19:42.950
I don't feel like doing it now, Ronin.

19:43.120 --> 19:46.560
Yes, protecting the shogunate
doesn't sound good!

19:46.760 --> 19:48.430
My apologies.

19:48.600 --> 19:56.160
But if you refuse to cooperate, I will forcibly
take Princess Yume to Osaka Castle.

19:56.360 --> 20:00.960
This is cowardly!
That's cowardly bargaining!

20:01.720 --> 20:04.760
I will follow Musashi wherever he goes!

20:05.360 --> 20:09.750
I will explain everything to Ishida Mitsunari.
I'm counting on you, Musashi.

20:09.960 --> 20:11.920
I got it, I got it.

20:12.760 --> 20:16.990
- Sasuke, protect Princess Kaguya.
- Will do.

20:17.160 --> 20:20.150
I will protect her with my life!

20:20.360 --> 20:27.000
Once we enter Osaka, we will set off again
towards the castle to the west of the map.

20:27.200 --> 20:30.910
I will leave toward the castle in
the north, in the country of Kai.

20:31.560 --> 20:35.160
And we are going to go east.

20:35.320 --> 20:38.680
In any case, we wanted to
go toward Aoba Castle.

20:40.840 --> 20:45.990
I now head east with Musashi, Ronin and Ninjataro.

20:46.160 --> 20:49.120
Kaguya, Danjo and Sarutobi went west.

20:50.160 --> 20:53.790
Sanada and his warriors went north.

20:53.960 --> 20:55.870
Everyone went off on their own.

20:56.360 --> 20:59.350
Isn't it dangerous to
spend the night here?

20:59.560 --> 21:03.110
Not at all, and Yume said
she wanted to stay here.

21:03.320 --> 21:06.600
Musashi is very courteous to Princess Yume.

21:09.000 --> 21:15.680
That's true! If I asked to take a break,
you'd leave me on the side of the road!

21:16.000 --> 21:18.320
Quiet, Ninjajozaburo!

21:18.520 --> 21:20.040
My name is Ninja<i>goro</i>!

21:21.160 --> 21:22.310
<i>Goro</i>?

21:22.320 --> 21:24.200
Just kidding!

21:24.760 --> 21:27.640
You always defile my name on purpose!

21:28.720 --> 21:29.800
Yeah!

21:29.800 --> 21:30.950
They're coming!

21:35.200 --> 21:37.760
The ayakashi?
The air is getting heavy...

21:48.360 --> 21:49.590
These banners...

21:49.800 --> 21:51.070
WIND

21:51.280 --> 21:52.510
FOREST

21:52.720 --> 21:53.990
FIRE

21:54.200 --> 21:55.470
MOUNTAIN

21:56.000 --> 21:57.720
Wind, fire, forest, mountain...

21:57.880 --> 22:01.030
Those are the banners of
Shingen Takeda's armies!

22:01.600 --> 22:04.990
Yes! But I doubt that is Shingen Takeda!

22:05.720 --> 22:08.310
With four of us, we don't stand a chance!

22:08.520 --> 22:14.100
Actually, only two of us will fight!
Run away with Yume, Ninjahappyakurokujohachigo!

22:14.120 --> 22:18.270
Hey! This is not the time to joke around!

22:19.040 --> 22:21.110
I have a horrible feeling about this.

22:21.280 --> 22:23.640
Be careful, Musashi.

22:46.720 --> 22:48.230
Demons again?

22:57.400 --> 23:00.070
Stop being a slob and get out here!

23:06.240 --> 23:09.470
Musashi, this ayakashi looks really powerful.

23:13.000 --> 23:15.120
Is that you, Musashi?

23:15.320 --> 23:19.360
Musashi, this ayakashi is different.

23:19.560 --> 23:21.180
How can you tell?

23:21.560 --> 23:24.120
Princess Yume, different how?

23:24.960 --> 23:28.430
I feel he has a human soul.

23:28.640 --> 23:34.110
I am the Lord of the country of Kai,
<i>Minamoto no Harunobu</i>, Shingen Takeda.

23:35.040 --> 23:38.670
Shingen Takeda has been
dead for over thirty years!

23:38.840 --> 23:40.240
Maybe it's a clone.

23:40.760 --> 23:44.880
I was resurrected after a thirty-year sleep!

23:45.240 --> 23:47.340
- What did he say?
- Here he comes!

23:47.680 --> 23:51.440
I'm here to kill a boy named Musashi!

23:51.640 --> 23:54.920
Master Musashi, it's a giant tiger!

24:00.310 --> 24:03.060
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:03.060 --> 24:05.900
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:05.900 --> 24:11.240
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.240 --> 24:16.370
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:17.910 --> 24:23.040
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:23.040 --> 24:29.220
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.220 --> 24:34.550
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.550 --> 24:38.680
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:41.060 --> 24:51.450
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.450 --> 25:02.370
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.370 --> 25:05.130
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.130 --> 25:08.000
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:08.000 --> 25:13.590
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.590 --> 25:16.350
I'll bring out every part

25:16.350 --> 25:19.350
of your unchanging style

25:19.350 --> 25:24.650
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.650 --> 25:29.820
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:31.000 --> 25:34.390
What?
Our castle is under water?

25:34.560 --> 25:37.950
And the ayakashi are
attacking one after another!

25:38.120 --> 25:39.710
We won't get away this time!

25:40.520 --> 25:43.670
The next chapter: <i>Sunken Castle</i>!
